If Sokoban is too boring for your taste, skip it. Yes, you get a nice
price at the end, but if you feel that it is not worth the trouble and
tedium getting there, then don't do it. (I can sympathise with that.)

But you might want to creat a small fort on the first level. This can hold
your stash (safe of wandering monsters, because you enter Sokoban only to
access your stash), and gives a convenient point of retreat. Also, the
easily accessible scrolls of earth can save you when swarmed.

